S1 tools/dpf/src/run/runner.ts   new   (C9's RunOptions/RunResult are the contract; EXIT_OK and EXIT_PAUSED come from 'spec-pipeline/protocol', W2-01 — never a literal 0/4, C6)
S2 tools/spec-pipeline/src/driver/exit-codes.ts:7-26   grep 'EXIT_OK'   exit codes 0/2/3/4/5/6/7/8 the runner maps
