        n = the number in counterFile, or 0 if it is absent; entry = plan[n]; write n + 1 to counterFile.
        (The FIRST call takes plan[0].)
     2. mkdir -p FAKE_SP_DIR and FAKE_SP_DIR/paused.
     3. entry.ledger (an array, optional): append each element to FAKE_SP_DIR/ledger.jsonl as one
        JSON line. entry.state (optional): replace FAKE_SP_DIR/state.json with
