        replace FAKE_SP_DIR/paused/<step>.json with JSON.stringify(entry.paused.payload, null, 2) + '\n'.
        These are the pipeline dir's real names (LEDGER_FILENAME, STATE_FILENAME, PAUSE_DIRNAME);
        the fake is plain node and cannot import the .ts protocol, so it spells them.
     4. append JSON.stringify(process.argv.slice(2)) + '\n' to calls.jsonl beside FAKE_SP_PLAN
        (slice(2): argv[0] is node, argv[1] is this script — W2-05's T5 indexes argv from 'ir').
