WHY
`tools/dpf` shows one progress line per step and detects a pause, but it reads the pipeline's
files (state.json and ledger.jsonl) and starts its commands — nothing else. It needs a dpf-local
`RunState` (not the pipeline's zod schema) to read the cursor and step statuses, and a ledger
